  "displayField" : "NAME", 
  "description" : "\u003cDIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;\"\u003e\u003cDIV\u003e\u003cDIV\u003e\u003cP\u003e\u003cSPAN\u003eThere are eleven parishes, and their boundaries are avaible by worded description and also by a printed map. \u003c/SPAN\u003e\u003c/P\u003e\u003cP\u003e\u003cSPAN\u003eThe attribute data details the size of each parish and their name. The coastal boundary of all parishes are derived from 1989 data and may differ from coastal boundary data in several instances.\u003c/SPAN\u003e\u003c/P\u003e\u003c/DIV\u003e\u003c/DIV\u003e\u003c/DIV\u003e", 
